@TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

### Create a production record
# @name create
POST {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-11-21T12:00:00Z",
  "type": "Production",
  "biddingZone": "DK1",
  "energySource": "Wind",
  "value": 460.5
}

### Get the record just created
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Update it
PUT {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-11-21T12:00:00Z",
  "type": "Production",
  "biddingZone": "DK1",
  "energySource": "Wind",
  "value": 475.0
}

### Delete it
DELETE {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Unknown ID -> 404
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Invalid: flow without target zone -> 400
POST {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-11-21T12:00:00Z",
  "type": "Flow",
  "biddingZone": "DK1",
  "value": 300
}

### Fetch calls
### List all records
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries

### Filter by bidding zone
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries?biddingZone=DK1

### Filter by interval
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries?from=2026-11-21T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-22T00:00:00Z

### Filter by zone and interval
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries?biddingZone=DK1&from=2026-11-21T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-22T00:00:00Z

### Invalid interval (from after to) -> 400
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries?from=2026-11-22T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-21T00:00:00Z

### Non-UTC timestamp -> 400 (note: + must be encoded as %2B)
GET {{TimeSeries.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timeseries?from=2026-11-21T00:00:00%2B01:00